<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <title>About - Krishna Contest 2026</title>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e3f2fd 0%, #bbdefb 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 25px;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a237e 0%, #283593 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 60px 40px;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
        }

        .header::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 30px;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 50% 50% 0 0;
        }

        .header-icon {
            font-size: 56px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            animation: pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        @keyframes pulse {
            0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); }
            50% { transform: scale(1.1); }
        }

        .header h1 {
            font-size: 36px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .header p {
            font-size: 18px;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 50px 50px 60px;
        }

        .content p {
            color: #37474f;
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .section {
            margin-top: 40px;
        }

        .section h3 {
            color: #1a237e;
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            border-bottom: 3px solid rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.3);
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .info-card {
            background: rgba(26, 35, 126, 0.05);
            border-left: 4px solid #1a237e;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .info-card p {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .info-card strong {
            color: #1a237e;
        }

        .contact-details {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.1) 0%, rgba(255, 193, 7, 0.05) 100%);
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            margin-top: 25px;
            border: 2px solid rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.3);
        }

        .contact-details p {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            margin: 12px 0;
            color: #37474f;
        }

        .contact-details p::before {
            font-size: 24px;
        }

        .contact-details p:nth-child(1)::before {
            content: '📧';
        }

        .contact-details p:nth-child(2)::before {
            content: '📱';
        }

        .back-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            color: #1a237e;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            background: rgba(26, 35, 126, 0.08);
            border-radius: 30px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .back-btn:hover {
            background: rgba(26, 35, 126, 0.15);
            transform: translateX(-5px);
        }

        .footer-note {
            text-align: center;
            color: #78909c;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-top: 40px;
            padding-top: 30px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .content, .header {
                padding: 40px 30px;
            }

            .header h1 {
                font-size: 28px;
            }

            .section h3 {
                font-size: 20px;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            body {
                padding: 20px 15px;
            }

            .content, .header {
                padding: 30px 25px;
            }

            .header h1 {
                font-size: 24px;
            }

            .header-icon {
                font-size: 42px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <a href="/" class="back-btn">← Back to Home</a>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <div class="header-icon">🕉️</div>
            <h1>About Krishna Contest</h1>
            <p>Celebrating Devotion, Creativity & Culture</p>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <p>
                <strong>Krishna Contest 2026</strong> is a devotional and cultural initiative organized by
                the <strong>International Society for Krishna Consciousness (ISKCON)</strong>, aimed at promoting 
                spiritual values, creative expression, and devotional culture across India.
            </p>

            <p>
                The contest provides a unique platform for participants to showcase their talents in various 
                categories including painting, essay writing, devotional singing, and other spiritual activities. 
                Our mission is to inspire devotion to Lord Krishna while nurturing artistic and literary talents 
                among participants of all ages.
            </p>

            <div class="section">
                <h3>🎯 Our Mission</h3>
                <p>
                    To promote devotion, creativity, scriptural knowledge, and cultural values through engaging 
                    contests that celebrate the divine teachings and pastimes of Lord Krishna. We aim to create 
                    a spiritual community that values both traditional wisdom and creative expression.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="section">
                <h3>🏛️ About the Organizer</h3>
                <div class="info-card">
                    <p><strong>International Society for Krishna Consciousness (ISKCON) Tirupati</strong></p>
                    <p>ISKCON is a registered religious and cultural organization dedicated to spreading the 
                    teachings of Bhagavad Gita and promoting Krishna consciousness worldwide. With millions 
                    of followers and centers across the globe, ISKCON continues to inspire spiritual growth 
                    and cultural enrichment.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="section">
                <h3>📞 Contact Information</h3>
                <div class="contact-details">
                    <p>support@iskconcontest.org</p>
                    <p>+91-9493805059</p>
                    <p><strong>Registered Address:</strong> Hare Krishna Land, Hare Krishna Road, Vinayaka Nagar, Tirupati - 517501, Andhra Pradesh, India.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="footer-note">
                <p>© 2026 Krishna National Contest. All Rights Reserved.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
